OL,3,GNEWSAGraphics show how city's revamped
OL,4,Apool could look
OL,5,
OL,6,FPictures have shown how Colchester's
OL,7,Fpopular leisure pool could look after a
OL,8,F#1.4m revamp.
OL,10,FFlume upgrades, a new splash pad and
OL,11,Fimproved changing rooms are all planned
OL,12,Fwhen work at Leisure World begins on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FVisitors to the centre had criticised
OL,16,Fit for being dirty in late 2025.
OL,18,FMartin Goss, the Colchester city
OL,19,Fcouncillor responsible for leisure,
OL,20,Fsaid it would be future-proofed thanks
OL,21,Fto the works.
